WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.820
Coach wanted.

2
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.260
No experience needed.

3
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.410
Strong stomach required.

4
00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:06.770
Glizzy Manager.

5
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:07.970
Pick one of sixteen

6
00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.250
characters and take them

7
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.680
through the league.

8
00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.040
The match is simple.

9
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.080
Hide the glizzy under a

10
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.080
hat, a sock or a box.

11
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.440
The other one guesses.

12
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.400
Three grabs,

13
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.470
you eat it, you lose.

14
00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.750
You don't play.

15
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.030
You prepare.

16
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.310
Three months before each

17
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.430
cup, one move a month:

18
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:26.670
train, rest,

19
00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.270
or media for cash.

20
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:29.830
Money goes on security,

21
00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:30.750
investments and

22
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:31.790
sabotage.

23
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.230
And watch the card:

24
00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:34.790
ego over seventy-five,

25
00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:35.630
and they play on their

26
00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.660
own.

27
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.020
Four cups a year,

28
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:39.140
straight into a bracket

29
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.380
of sixteen.

30
00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:42.300
A title, twenty points.

31
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.900
A win, three.

32
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.940
A loss, minus one.

33
00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:46.980
First to three hundred

34
00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.050
is Glizzy Overlord.

35
00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.370
There are sponsors,

36
00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.890
who double as parties.

37
00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:52.970
The Assembly.

38
00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.010
Elections.

39
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:54.970
Favors.

40
00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:56.560
You'll figure it out.

41
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.920
Glizzy Rivals:

42
00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:58.800
same league,

43
00:00:58.800 --> 00:00:59.840
multiplayer.

44
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.200
Up to eight coaches,

45
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.520
one room code.

46
00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:03.440
Everyone's off-season

47
00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.480
runs at once,

48
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.200
you watch the cup

49
00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.360
together, bet,

50
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.390
and sabotage each other.

51
00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:10.620
Out-eat your friends.
